# 7. If you want a quick smoke test first

Before full run, do a 10-sample test:

```powershell
python -m scripts.generate_multiview_dataset_v2 `
  --source "E:\BODMAS_GW\BODMAS_disarmed_malware_binaries.zip" `
  --output-dir "E:\TRAMIF_jobs\smoke_test" `
  --modalities all `
  --splits train validation `
  --worker-id smoke-test `
  --limit 10
```

Then remove `--limit 10` for the full run.

